{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_29c55ca8eb0bd52a891fc4369c17d5368182cc5a0310939b79220770a7be41ea","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_99fcc786d11d67a7a7b2f8c917952b9c6010d8e374813e5c7722aaf5d9fb717c","slc_ea50a3f67ccb8f83cc5c90837faeb42c27639eadd94f24d035724c7951b89b76"],"source_ids":["src_c7194927ce765c25af06663cc65b0c15"],"text":"Cluster-specific Pod settings (sysctls, nodeSelectors, tolerations, imagePullSecrets, injector annotations) are injected via a corev1.PodTemplateSpec stored in a ConfigMap under the key pod-template.yaml, read on every Create call.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2fcb2767dcd69536896f4d6f3873c56736be3e76f8268cbd7bd87683564d1c4a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36b887c9b126f0980ba5c01ef8cb98e25d2a788641b5d98f22b8688f813d13d7","slc_9a530e1edfcc743ff977c53fbd16d10ad5f319bfa825516d8f0efe2d281a0316","slc_a980e264671d3654f3512d51d57fb1ed66a4268fb4d6d4499053db00e94a7c3b","slc_c20e66c5ba98bd2d14d5d00453fc79d26de99a1da5bf423f8c69db93a34e7410"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"Per the internal progress doc, ConfigVersionManager, versions.json management, skill hot-update (UpgradeSkills), runtime rolling upgrade, agt config push, debug commands, apply --prune, and all Phase 4 debug/upgrade capabilities are unimplemented.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ff6055117851266b4f13e022f2b0b932dcdd3548955b1681111fe93b54047d0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c72bcf5808f01d38144cfc612f320c455be49491fa3c04f59684841a5af8995c"],"source_ids":["src_c7194927ce765c25af06663cc65b0c15"],"text":"The controller creates one Kubernetes Pod per Manager and Worker; by default each Pod has a single 'worker' container, a projected agentteams-token volume, and the controller-managed ServiceAccount.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4897f815bb90c844c68b4e1e38184a56a3c1109b24a4677708c5d674c6d8e6c6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13adb8927807b06291a671f37e073ba249f49492b774e1eabf6e475f4ca9fdae","slc_14649bd58e4b4a3acc90ed9e77b69aa819591ee794988aeb667b7eabc238ce06","slc_165f83d4f08af488bcd1adbf7e6c25eeb07a7baf01f3dfb989f90b2bad5cbc50","slc_1771a556c508d82afa559610ea57afc9ceaad3f05cdc76a76d0e3a351eda8082","slc_2d6a1f279ed1d1ea876aba66627d120d43d34045e556ced03f1bb4344d084076","slc_6ddcd3860fb04278bf56558e99732fbb17a7cdf563ccc05b8793ee52cc921770","slc_8d12c5f773e11f6a39198c6fb8d2e1bec306a897f7f8d0e04048100199894b0d"],"source_ids":["src_16b0962d5925536dae9f69f37e20b85e"],"text":"The refactor design gives Team Leaders heartbeat-based worker lifecycle management (wake/sleep, idle timeout) with controller-enforced permission isolation: leaders may only manage workers of their own team, and workers cannot manage other workers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55a9e34017ba14a6aab899ad5923f1ac573f98603c29947b74c2e4f696e04e8a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5773c908182c903543bb88cb644935ee42c6ed0eac70b3c2b21120843cdcb066"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"The progress doc marks Phase 3 items partially done: Manager state.json-to-OSS migration and quota checks are unimplemented, and fine-grained CallerIdentity isolation beyond SA token authentication remains incomplete.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_56909b6ed46a9a9058cc5b7f33e51de55d3e8af237e135514317470f652005cd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_061ccd91f714ef4fc95741695ec05970d0d61dcb7685cb283f0ff20af48acb42"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"Worker, Team, Human, and Manager CRDs each have Helm crds/, api/v1beta1 types, and reconcilers marked complete, while the DebugWorker CRD is not implemented.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_57a96008aceb4f0cb8e22c19e62fce375b2aed703084d11bcfb9bb54000a437a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_af9774a7c09f9cead3cbf2b5ef51be965b814cfff4fd0d048e5f4c7b90714ec4","slc_c20e66c5ba98bd2d14d5d00453fc79d26de99a1da5bf423f8c69db93a34e7410"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"The agt CLI was rewritten as a pure REST API client calling the controller at AGENTTEAMS_CONTROLLER_URL (default http://localhost:8090), supporting CRUD for workers/teams/humans/managers, worker wake/sleep/status, YAML and ZIP apply, with tokens via AGENTTEAMS_AUTH_TOKEN or SA token file discovery.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7fe0e4579ffa2c346dc39525b89526470f17a21429249aaeff5387821a2a9ad9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0c8673228c350850a84a56fb62004d9d00c03375d45cd6070aba6f94398bc1e2","slc_12e0cdbf2522294ee73c9d5e0141790ef5b7121b1e33f4b8279accc062643f10","slc_d55af57d9eb7ee3cd8aeb8a84c46562e07e49059bbf7588034502c307c462591"],"source_ids":["src_c7194927ce765c25af06663cc65b0c15"],"text":"Merge semantics are field-specific: the template wins for nodeSelector, tolerations, affinity, securityContext, and non-worker sidecar containers; the controller wins for ownerReferences, serviceAccountName, forced automountServiceAccountToken=false, and the agent container's image/env; labels and annotations merge with controller values overwriting on key collision.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a415dcb4911d3dd6aa014005e8ad0fa4787e6c6fd4b1a6fa220578ae78f76b54","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_95e5f75a87236d7ed93a57b4c6a916ffc37dabd741d9f87e1d1201ec905b2591","slc_c3b0095d2535d470ab2855b8d5385ecdbbacc081e08983a55c306138c8dcc9ee"],"source_ids":["src_c7194927ce765c25af06663cc65b0c15"],"text":"The pod template ConfigMap is read fresh on each Pod creation with no caching: edits affect the next created Pod while existing Pods are untouched; a missing, malformed, or unfetchable ConfigMap falls back to the default Pod shape without blocking creation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b8704347047e463dd3187992c90c92b5d3cdbc3f7b393bab11d5c84481f5a1a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5400dc027c1d8e0386380e2f5249183ee308a61ff2b284935c8a26cf706be678","slc_d99e90c463127767a1fa51d0e861868c5d92fcaabb0239f95b5df1ba999656b2"],"source_ids":["src_16b0962d5925536dae9f69f37e20b85e"],"text":"The design targets two deployment modes: K8s incluster via Helm, and backward-compatible embedded mode where the controller manages worker containers through the Docker socket and runs an embedded kube-apiserver plus kine (SQLite) as a K8s API compatibility layer.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d7d96f67ea5eb51e39aeefcb5b0fd7aa8740698b6e84646bce3bdc0a1752f8e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e41f6cd96025c4c8e4d9d469eb64ee5cfdd4c2d865b5d2b91b102f7509318ac6"],"source_ids":["src_c7194927ce765c25af06663cc65b0c15"],"text":"AGENTTEAMS_CONTROLLER_NAME doubles as the leader-election lease name and the agentteams.io/controller label stamped on created CRs; informer caches filter by this label so multiple releases in one namespace do not reconcile each other's resources, and incluster startup without it fails fast.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dd206cd13be8d19ec200150eeee0becb82dbc26a45669589d7115c34930483fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8e9ff1ca36baa624b2538f561ca9b7526cb4ba31ad7d5c85b24658df718e0683","slc_c48641889446a48bf7fa408b57289b9e309345dd63901ae161e9971a9c46b656"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"A WorkerBackend abstraction layer unifies worker lifecycle management; the progress doc marks the interface, Docker backend, Kubernetes backend, and backend auto-selection as complete, and lists additional SAE, APIG gateway, gateway abstraction, and cloud-credential files as implemented beyond the design.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dffb6accce2b95fc792a6648d4e30ea6d2045e60f6c3e0547226edf7d4222210","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_96410918a477d1b7684ae29e2b4d9969a62b78f8bd3f787b2ff3e758d2cd4b61"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"The Helm chart ships controller Deployment/Service/RBAC/ServiceAccount, Tuwunel and MinIO StatefulSets, Higress as a subchart, Element Web, and a Manager Deployment; an Ingress template is not yet implemented per the progress doc.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f894b5256aca07f47e53efd559589e098761386a79069f96291c384af67aeaa5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"agentscope-ai/agentteams@f65d6e1af268 snapshot 00898cd68a276fb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b5d0d142c87c5327443ebdffcab0b493740dce31514764b6a9d24ab4fcd55fbc"],"source_ids":["src_e52e0003371754c0afa9781e8ac3d2cc"],"text":"An embedded all-in-one image bundles Higress, Tuwunel, MinIO, Element Web, the controller, CLI, and kube-apiserver, started in layers via supervisord; deployment is dual-container (controller container plus an auto-created manager-agent container created via DockerBackend).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
